      "content": {
        "title": "The Muppets Christmas Carol",
        "text": "This movie is fun and easy to watch. It has many cute puppets[人形], music[音楽], and jokes[冗談]. The story teaches a good lesson[教訓] about being kind[親切] and helping[助ける] others.\nIt is also a famous[有名] Christmas story, so it is good for learning about Christmas culture[文化].\nI think you will enjoy[楽しむ] this movie!",
        "imageUrl": "assets/images/muppetchristmascarol.webp"
      },
      "createdAt": "2025-12-08T06:46:11.794Z",
      "layout": "poster-left"
    },
