      "content": {
        "title": "Elf",
        "text": "This movie is very funny[おもしろい] and cheerful[明るい]. It is about a man who grows up with elves[妖精 yōsei] at the North Pole[北極 hokkyoku]. He goes to New York to find his real family[家族], and many silly[ばかげた] things happen.\n\nThe movie teaches us to believe[信じる] in ourselves and to be kind[親切] to others.",
        "imageUrl": "assets/images/elf.jpg"
      },
      "createdAt": "2025-12-08T06:49:08.903Z",
      "layout": "poster-right"
    },
