      "content": {
        "title": "Klaus",
        "text": "This movie is beautiful[美しい] and funny. It is about a postman[郵便配達人] who goes to a cold, lonely[さびしい] town and meets a toy maker[おもちゃ職人] named Klaus. They start giving gifts[贈り物] to children, and the town becomes happy[幸せ] again.\nI like this movie because it feels warm[あたたかい], has simple funny moments[面白い場面], and shows that small kindness[親切] can make big change[変化].",
        "imageUrl": "assets/images/klaus.webp"
      },
      "createdAt": "2025-12-08T22:32:26.495Z",
